note bottom of OOMHandler
  run, consume, and GPU new_stage share run_with_runner_impl.
  That free function owns the retry scope and invokes RunnerRetryAdapter.
  new_stage is available only with NoInputAdjuster, NoStageAdjuster, S = ().
  CPU run and CPU new_stage bypass the OOM retry loop.
end note

note bottom of OomFastPathKey
  Used by module-level OOM_FAST_PATH_DISABLED:
  OnceLock<DashSet<OomFastPathKey>>.
  Keys identify task, input, selector types, and device.
  The handler does not own this global set.
end note

note bottom of ConsumeRunnerRetryAdapter
  Takes owned input for each attempt.
  On ConsumeResult::Failed, restores it with W::burp(input).
end note
